{"id":"7a63648901cbcd33","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-proof-code.md","title":"Proof and Theorem Codes in P.E. and P.A.","display":"df-smullyan-proof-code — Proof and Theorem Codes in P.E. and P.A.","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-proof-code"],"display":"df-smullyan-proof-code — Proof and Theorem Codes in P.E. and P.A.","source":"第 III 章 pp. 30、35–36；第 IV 章 p. 49（PDF 47、52–53、66）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]","[[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]]","[[92-df-proof]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-proof-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-proof-code — Proof and Theorem Codes in P.E. and P.A."},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 30、35–36；第 IV 章 p. 49（PDF 47、52–53、66）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"920841c1841d30c3\" href=\"?note=920841c1841d30c3\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems\">92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"495bb24d4506a7c2\" href=\"?note=495bb24d4506a7c2\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-sequence-code\">92-df-smullyan-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>一般有限证明关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_S\\)</span>、可证关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E,\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E\">\\(g_E,\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E\\)</span> 为原书编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}proof\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists(F_1,\\ldots,F_k)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k\\;[\nq=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(g_E(F_1),\\ldots,g_E(F_k))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land m=g_E(F_k)\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_S(\\langle F_1,\\ldots,F_k\\rangle,F_k)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pf}_S(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m),\\\\\nP_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{m:\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)\\},\\\\\nR_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\ g_E(\\neg_E F)\\in P_S^\\#\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}proof\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists(F_1,\\ldots,F_k)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k\\;[\nq=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(g_E(F_1),\\ldots,g_E(F_k))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land m=g_E(F_k)\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_S(\\langle F_1,\\ldots,F_k\\rangle,F_k)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pf}_S(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m),\\\\\nP_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{m:\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)\\},\\\\\nR_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\ g_E(\\neg_E F)\\in P_S^\\#\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,m\">\\(q,m\\)</span> 是外部自然数，Proof 的参数则是公式序列和公式，两层不能混写。原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PE}(m),\\mathrm{PA}(m)\">\\(\\mathrm{PE}(m),\\mathrm{PA}(m)\\)</span> 也可用“m 属于某证明序列”定义：该序列截到首次出现 m 的前缀就是以 m 结尾的证明，故与这里的末项版本等价。</p>\n<p>没有把 Pf 的图关系直接写成对象语言公式；第 IV 章的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 构造和语法判定结果提供后续表示依据。非法序列码与非法公式码均在右侧存在式之外。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","status":"resolved","id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"495bb24d4506a7c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"一般有限证明关系 $\\mathrm{Proof}_S$、可证关系见 [[92-df-proof]]、[[92-df-provable]]；$g_E,\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E$ 为原书编号。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"一般有限证明关系 $\\mathrm{Proof}_S$、可证关系见 [[92-df-proof]]、[[92-df-provable]]；$g_E,\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E$ 为原书编号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g_E,\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}proof\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists(F_1,\\ldots,F_k)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k\\;[\nq=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(g_E(F_1),\\ldots,g_E(F_k))\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\land m=g_E(F_k)\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_S(\\langle F_1,\\ldots,F_k\\rangle,F_k)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pf}_S(q)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m),\\\\\nP_S^\\#&\\coloneqq\\{m:\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)\\},\\\\\nR_S^\\#&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\ g_E(\\neg_E F)\\in P_S^\\#\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PE}(m),\\mathrm{PA}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1931,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的字符表、13 进位编码、包裹实例与对角码由[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]至[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]另行记载。它们给出原书的编码机制；此前修订已在 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]、[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]、[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]、[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 独立补齐原书语法、公理和编码，保留旧 G 支线。没有构造两种字符呈现之间的完整证明翻译，也没有提供机器核验。"},{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]"},{"id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文是一般系统上的有限证明。代入原书 P.E./P.A. 三元组后得到其逐行有限证明；自然数编码必须另取 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 的 # 序列编号。"},{"id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可证性是存在以该公式结尾的有限证明。它与原书编码谓词 PE/PA 一致的前提，是使用 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 的原书编码，不是把 G 的公式码直接拿来。"},{"id":"942add4e9888c0f5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本定义的两个参数是 G 的语法对象。原书 Pf 是对 # 编码的外部自然数谓词，另见 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]；二者的定义域和编号都不同。"},{"id":"bf315ef87cd91c88","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本引理针对固定 G 的有界元数 MP/Gen。逐行前提索引只能在有限的先行行中选，合法公式码/序列码以及这些有限循环都需要 PR 算法；前提若换成任意可判定的规则集，不能维持同一 PR 结论。原书的 # 序列/PE 另见 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"678e4ae13575ec1c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"71962c0a446ff8b2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba289179148c44b3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]"}],"outgoing":["920841c1841d30c3","495bb24d4506a7c2","23b675b1348a813e","51c43e0240787ebb"]}